msgid "Qiskit Mitigation {#qiskit-mitigation}"
msgstr "Qiskit Mitigation {#qiskit-mitigation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Mitigation is a package for handling noise in quantum computations. It contains a set of techniques that can be used to build advanced or customized error mitigation pipelines directly with [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic). Specifically, it contains:\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Mitigation es un paquete para manejar el ruido en cálculos cuánticos. Contiene un conjunto de técnicas que se pueden usar para construir flujos de mitigación de errores avanzados o personalizados directamente con [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic). En concreto, contiene:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implementations of Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), and Zero-Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) with Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA) and gate folding amplification methods.\n"
msgstr "Implementaciones de Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX) y Zero-Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) con Probabilistic Error Amplification (PEA) y métodos de amplificación por plegado de puertas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Functionality for computing a postselected noise channel, from circuit symmetries or spacetime checks, to be used with PEC to reduce sampling overhead [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Funcionalidad para calcular un canal de ruido postseleccionado, a partir de simetrías del circuito o comprobaciones espaciotemporales, para usarlo con PEC y reducir la sobrecarga de muestreo [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Postselection using non-Markovian error checks to filter corrupted samples out of measured data.\n"
msgstr "Postselección mediante comprobaciones de errores no markovianos para filtrar las muestras corruptas de los datos medidos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for expectation value calculation with advanced error mitigation.\n"
msgstr "Soporte para el cálculo de valores esperados con mitigación de errores avanzada.\n"

