# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The developer guide is located at [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) in the root of this project’s repository. By participating, you are expected to uphold Qiskit’s [code of conduct](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n"
msgstr "La guía para desarrolladores se encuentra en [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md), en la raíz del repositorio de este proyecto. Al participar, se espera que respetes el [código de conducta](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) de Qiskit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) for tracking requests and bugs.\n"
msgstr "Usamos [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) para el seguimiento de solicitudes y errores.\n"

